  "content": "<p>\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/refs/heads/dev/images/logo.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fflightassistant\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available on Modrinth\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Requires Fabric API\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fflightassistant%252fversions%253fl%253dforge%2526l%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available for Forge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5kcBCvnbTp\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chat with us on Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>FlightAssistant</strong> 是一款功能强大的客户端模组，它为 Minecraft 的鞘翅提供了完全可配置的全套航空电子设备、情境感知工具和高级自动化功能，同时依然对休闲用户友好。</p>\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完全自定义的飞行 HUD（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/HUD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>实时显示飞行数据的详细信息显示界面\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/full_screenshot_alt.png\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>智能飞行安全警报（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Alerts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>在情况变得太晚之前，了解危险的飞行条件\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/alert_display_alt.png\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>非侵入式的自动飞行保护（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Flight-protections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>当你没有注意时，FlightAssistant 会保护你\n<li>示例：避免地面碰撞伤害、避免虚空伤害、自动展开鞘翅</li></ul></li>\n<li>具备飞行规划功能的先进自动驾驶仪：完全解放双手安全飞行（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Autopilot:-overview-and-basics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>飞行计划可以保存到磁盘并稍后加载\n<li>使用飞行计划，可以从起飞到降落完全自动地执行飞行\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/full_screenshot.png\"></li></ul></li>\n</ul>",
